<title>UK: BayerVB sets 1.0 bln mark five-year bond, +30 b.p.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 1.0 bln mark five-year bond, +30 b.p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Pfandbrief issue was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Vereinsbank, Caisse des Depots et Consignations, Dresdner Bank, Goldman Sachs and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    12.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    12.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+30 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    MUNICH    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIP     NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OBL 119</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
